    {
      "content": "It's an all inclusive hourly rate. There's no trip fees, no taxes, no credit card fees. If anything needs to be padded and wrapped, we'll have those on-hand. We'll have tools to help with reassembly of a bed frame or anything that may need it. Everything's also fully insured and then the way that it works is we do a 2.5 hour minimum which is $480 once we exceed the minimum we bill in fifteen minute increments until the move is completed. So you do just pay for time needed that day. But yeah, you're going to be in the range of about the minimum to maybe 3.5 hours is that standard for a 10x10 and for a one bedroom apartment? So probably $480 to 672 would be your cost range. And yeah all of our movers are background checked and trained in-house we do have our no worries damage coverage. It's high evaluation for your items just to give you peace of mind, you know, we cover everything well above and beyond the industry standard and we do have an on time guarantee. So for over late, we do discount money back.",
